{"id":"09833e5945eb7509","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate.md","title":"Delta-bounded Definable Predicate","display":"df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate — Delta-bounded Definable Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate","aliases":["72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate"],"display":"df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate — Delta-bounded Definable Predicate","depends_on":["[[72-df-delta-bounded]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3.2","source_printed_pages":"102","source_pdf_pages":"114","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate — Delta-bounded Definable Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9\" href=\"?note=b1b2bc1f3d190ee9\" title=\"72-df-delta-bounded\">72-df-delta-bounded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"102"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"114"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i^b(T)\">\\(\\Delta_i^b(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9\" href=\"?note=b1b2bc1f3d190ee9\" title=\"72-df-delta-bounded\">72-df-delta-bounded</a>；对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\omega\">\\(j\\in\\omega\\)</span> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j=v_j\">\\(x_j=v_j\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 为标准结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T):=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\;&amp;\n\\exists A\\in\\Delta_i^b(T)\\;[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n])]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)&amp;:=\\{(k,R):k\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T):=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\;&amp;\n\\exists A\\in\\Delta_i^b(T)\\;[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n])]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)&amp;:=\\{(k,R):k\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3.2，印刷 p. 102（PDF p. 114）；分别记录语法上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i^b(T)\">\\(\\Delta_i^b(T)\\)</span>、标准模型中被定义的关系、带元数的关系类。</li>\n<li>新增理由：原目录只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i^b\">\\(\\Delta_i^b\\)</span> 公式类，没有“理论可定义谓词”接口，无法精确表达印刷 p. 127 的 witnessing 推论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-delta-bounded","status":"resolved","id":"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-delta-bounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-delta-bounded","status":"resolved","id":"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_i^b(T)$ 取 [[72-df-delta-bounded]]；对所有 $j\\in\\omega$ 固定 $x_j=v_j$；对每个 $k$ 取 $\\vec x=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})$，$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 为标准结构。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_i^b(T)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x_j=v_j","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T):=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\;&\n\\exists A\\in\\Delta_i^b(T)\\;[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n])]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)&:=\\{(k,R):k\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_{i,k}(T)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_i^b(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_i^b","display":false}],"bytes":2078,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate|df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate — Delta-bounded Definable Predicate]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate|df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate — Delta-bounded Definable Predicate]]"},{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)$、$\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)$ 分别取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function]]、[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate]]；$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate|72-df-delta-bounded-de